 545. Therefore, the median is:\n\\[ \\text{Median} = \\frac{542 + 545}{2} = \\frac{1087}{2} = 543.5 \\]\n\n### Finding the Mode\nThe mode is the number that appears most frequently in the data set. From the list, we see that the number 542 appears twice, and no other number appears more frequently.\n\nThus, the mode is:\n\\[ \\text{Mode} = 542 \\]\n\n### Sum of the Median and Mode\nNow, we sum the median and the mode:\n\\[ 543.5 + 542 = 1085.5 \\]\n\nThus, the sum of the median and mode is:\n\\[\n\\boxed{1085.5}\n\\]"},"grade":{"answer":"\\boxed{1085.5}","correct":false,"format":"boxed","parseable":true}}
